        <mxCell id="-DPXh-h7QqhF4jSscgDO-72" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Grid substation 220/110/20 kV with a three-winding transformer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;220 kV grid (S&quot;k max/min 12000/8000 MVA) and a 160/160/50 MVA YNyn0d5 three-winding transformer.&lt;br&gt;The 20 kV tertiary carries a 10 Mvar capacitor bank and the station service transformer.&lt;br&gt;The 110 kV side feeds a meshed network of two towns (25 MW and 18 MW + 12 MW wind farm)&lt;br&gt;over 243-AL1/39 overhead lines.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Try:&lt;/b&gt; Load Flow – 110 kV flows in the mesh, tertiary loading, effect of the capacitor bank;&lt;br&gt;Short Circuit IEC 60909 at 220/110/20 kV; Contingency Analysis – loss of one 110 kV line." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#81c784;" vertex="1" parent="-DPXh-h7QqhF4jSscgDO-1">
